the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-48713","Person/Jan-Niklas Wortmann",["01:03:32 Security, YOLO, and Trust","01:03:33 YOLO Mode Forces Security Awareness","Transcript"]],["Person/Jan-Niklas%20Wortmann/Pod/26/06%20Code%20Isn%27t%20Free%20-%20Mario%20Zechner%20on%20the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-48752","Oh, no, I think, I'm not saying you're wrong. I never said you're wrong.",["01:03:33 YOLO Mode Forces Security Awareness","Transcript","Person/Jan-Niklas Wortmann"]],["Person/Jan-Niklas%20Wortmann/Pod/26/06%20Code%20Isn%27t%20Free%20-%20Mario%20Zechner%20on%20the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-48834","Person/Mario Zechner",["01:03:32 Security, YOLO, and Trust","01:03:33 YOLO Mode Forces Security Awareness","Transcript"]],["Person/Jan-Niklas%20Wortmann/Pod/26/06%20Code%20Isn%27t%20Free%20-%20Mario%20Zechner%20on%20the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-48867","My thing is this. By telling people, this is YOLO mode, it's dangerous, you better think about this, I actually make people think about that. I actually hope to make people think about that. Because initially people come to Pi and are like, oh, this is garbage because it doesn't have permissions. And I'm like, yeah, think about why it doesn't have permissions and then think about how you fix that on your end.",["01:03:33 YOLO Mode Forces Security Awareness","Transcript","Person/Mario Zechner"]],["Person/Jan-Niklas%20Wortmann/Pod/26/06%20Code%20Isn%27t%20Free%20-%20Mario%20Zechner%20on%20the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-49289","01:03:51 Make YOLO Explicit To Force Security Thinking",["Code Isn't Free - Mario Zechner on the Hard Truths of Coding With AI","Video","01:03:32 Security, YOLO, and Trust"]],["Person/Jan-Niklas%20Wortmann/Pod/26/06%20Code%20Isn%27t%20Free%20-%20Mario%20Zechner%20on%20the%20Hard%20Truths%20of%20Coding%20With%20AI/","source-block-49373","Snipd: https://shar